USB_INTERFACE - ESD protection, optional ISOUSB211 galvanic isolation (TI Fig 8-6), 0R bypass, VBUS detection
CONFIG A - ISOLATED (as drawn): ISOUSB211 + all its decoupling + 3V3_ISO LDO fitted; UD/DD 0R links fitted; V1OK link fitted.
BYPASS links, GROUND BRIDGE, VBUS divider + Schmitt buffer NOT fitted.
CONFIG B - NON-ISOLATED: ISOUSB211, its decoupling and the 3V3_ISO LDO NOT fitted; 4 x BYPASS 0R + 2 x GROUND BRIDGE 0R fitted;
VBUS divider + Schmitt buffer + its link fitted. Never fit both link sets.
USB VBUS is never connected to the local 5 V rail. Functional isolation only - not a safety barrier.
Ground symbols on this sheet: thick bar = GND_USB (USB host side) triangle = GND (local / audio side)
